{"productId": "61cda367-327f-44c0-b5c8-2d28fd42f227", "modelName": "1911 Emissary", "modelDescription": "The 1911 Emissary bridges defensive and custom pistols delivering a bold and capable addition to the Springfield Armory family of 1911's. Built on a durable foundation of forged steel in its barrel, slide and frame, the Emissary offers a pistol with an air of custom refinement. The pistol has a beautiful two-tone finish, with a blued carbon steel slide and a stainless-steel frame with squared trigger guard. A \"Tri-Top\" cut to the slide gives the pistol custom-grade styling, while a heavy-profile bull barrel delivers maximum accuracy and reduces felt recoil. Springfield Armorys U-Dot sights are ideal for defensive situations offering fast and intuitive acquisition while providing a tritium/luminescent front sight for low light conditions. Delivering ultra-fast lock times, the Emissary's skeletonized hammer combines excellent style with exceptional performance. Integrated into the forged steel frame is a strip of Picatinny accessory rail, ready to accept the light, laser or combo unit of your choice. It is fully wrapped in a grenade pattern texture for firm engagement in adverse conditions. The slim line VZ Grips are machined from G10 while the mainspring housing and front strap are machined to match.", "manufacturerName": "Springfield", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "1cdcff66-9c8f-42b2-ac7a-01cbae642ac5", "description": "Springfield, Emissary 1911, Single Action, 9MM, 5\" Match Grade Bull Barrel, Stainless Steel Frame and Carbon Steel Slide, Right Hand, 2 Magazines, 9 Rounds\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/71cb0f08-5e7a-4cbe-a731-5fee9bc02161", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/34d15054-2228-4aea-8204-af82fe7c629f", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f5c5c94f-df32-48b5-a9e7-a908253843e9", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b4915dc9-814c-40f